{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"standards\": [\n    {\n      \"std\": \"1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"只读线就能看清一个人从发现喜欢、谨慎靠近，到暴露心意、害怕失去，最终接受不确定性的完整经历；没有依赖珠子补充人物经历，也没有把珠子的画面翻译成真实事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"前面的经历持续成为后面的理由，尤其是S04到S06的暴露心意与重新获得自在、S07到S10的期待与不安、S11到S14的坦然与接受，内在变化有连续性，why-now基本清楚。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"整条线始终围绕亲密带来的幸福及其无法保证长久所产生的痛楚展开，即使S03暂时不去想未来，也仍然处在这份亲密之中。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"有问题\",\n      \"note\": \"各段的线和珠子大体有情境上的对应，但没有明确写出每条线分别对应哪几颗珠子，下一步仍需要自行判断对应关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"底线\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"人物动机、前后指代和关键转折的意思都能读清楚，没有足以让下一步照着错误意思改写的明显歧义。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"跨段\",\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"quote\": \"S02-3：两个人待在一起这么好，他偏偏想到这样的时刻总会过去，还没分开就先有一点舍不得。；S02-B2：人在船上舒服地漂着，暂时不急着靠岸，水却一直在流，时间也一直在走。／S04-3：他甚至盼着说出来能把眼下的好留得久一点；可又怕一下说得太多让对方为难。；S04-B3：想用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下。／S13-1：高兴过后，他更想听对方说以后也不变。；S13-B2：幸福没有消失，悲伤却进入了幸福内部。\",\n      \"why\": \"这些对应关系虽然大体能够推出来，但全文都只是把线和珠子按段并列，没有明确标出哪条线承接哪几颗珠子。下一步仍要逐段自行判断、分配对应关系，尤其一条线可能承接多颗珠子、同一段也有多条线，增加了自行整理和误配的工作。\",\n      \"severity\": \"中等\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "88e1e841-3c79-41dd-9789-a263997c6f1e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T172956563718Z", "elapsed_seconds": 275.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T17:34:31.697426+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3355f2b084729b6f930328e3ce2a898a3a6b4a3cae216ca0745ff02233c35a94", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T172956563718Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "67e335d9b993784784503caf196f0a16f37ba34c1d9ec70dff5a367c0a4324c5"}}}
